    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_about_transformer_1">
        <text>A transformer. I used to climb on those as a kid.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_about_underpass">
        <text>Let's go.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_come_back_1">
        <text>We shouldn't linger here. Let's go.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_idle_1">
        <text>Here... Too empty.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_idle_2">
        <text>I think I've been here before. I don't remember.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_idle_3">
        <text>Strange. Everything is strange here.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_no_meet_1">
        <text>Let's better stay silent.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_no_meet_2">
        <text>Not worth chatting idly.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_no_meet_3">
        <text>I don't want to talk right now.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_actor_assault_1">
        <text>Traitor.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_actor_hit_1">
        <text>Khe. There's no need for that.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_actor_hit_2">
        <text>Ugh, you shouldn't attack me.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_actor_hit_3">
        <text>Kh... I warned you.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_enemy_assault_sokolov_1">
        <text>Sokolov is dead.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_enemy_assault_vano_1">
        <text>Vano is dead.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_enemy_assault_zulus_1">
        <text>Zulus is dead.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_enemy_hit_1">
        <text>Gha...</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_enemy_hit_2">
        <text>Gh.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_on_enemy_hit_3">
        <text>Kh-kh...</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_wanderer_wait_for_me_1">
        <text>No need to rush. It's better to stick together here.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_control_gates_1">
        <text>The gates are locked. No button nearby. Any volunteers to run to the control room and see if there's anything suitable there?</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_cover_1">
        <text>Go ahead, brother. Don't worry about the rear.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_door_1">
        <text>Alright, the path is open. Let's go.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_exit_1">
        <text>Looks like we're already under Pripyat.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_gates">
        <text>Go ahead, brother. Press that button.</text>
    </string>
