        <text>Back to back, quickly!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_monolith_2">
        <text>Holy crap.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_obstacle_1">
        <text>Looks like we're not going through head-on.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_obstacle_2">
        <text>Alright, real heroes always go around.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_outfits_1">
        <text>So the suits came in handy.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_railway_1">
        <text>So, the gate power is off.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_sniper_first_1">
        <text>Snipers!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_snorks_1">
        <text>Alright, don't panic. Fire!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_train_gates_1">
        <text>Well, brother. Open it!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_train_gates_2">
        <text>That's what will happen to everyone!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_transformer_1">
        <text>Looks like a transformer. I wonder, are all the lines on?</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_about_underpass">
        <text>Well, let's move?</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_come_back_1">
        <text>Brother, don't fall behind. We need to go forward.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_idle_1">
        <text>What a place, holy crap.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_idle_2">
        <text>What a mess. At our base, for something like this...</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_idle_3">
        <text>Yeah, this is definitely no resort.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_no_meet_1">
        <text>Not the time to chat now.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_no_meet_2">
        <text>We'll talk when we get out.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_no_meet_3">
        <text>No talking!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_actor_assault_1">
        <text>Killing your own?! Ah, you!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_actor_hit_1">
        <text>Ah, watch where you're hitting!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_actor_hit_2">
        <text>Agh, stop maiming me!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_actor_hit_3">
        <text>Ay, fu... Where are you hitting? I'm on your...</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_enemy_assault_sokolov_1">
        <text>Sokolov is dead!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_enemy_assault_vano_1">
        <text>Vano was killed!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_enemy_assault_wanderer_1">
        <text>Strider is dead!</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_enemy_hit_1">
        <text>Agh.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_enemy_hit_2">
        <text>Agh.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_on_enemy_hit_3">
        <text>Agh.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="$characters_voice_scenario_underpass_pas_b400_zulus_wait_for_me_1">
        <text>Brother, come back. We'll do without reconnaissance.</text>
    </string>
